# Mirrors the root repo's .gitattributes. A submodule is its own git repository and
# does NOT inherit the parent's attributes — that gap is why a CRLF->LF slip in this
# service showed up as a 363-line diff for a 12-line change (2026-08-24).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cjs  text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
